NEW:
PID|1||NC00000236^^^RNS|

CURRENT:
PID|1||MU00003306^^^RNS^~E482EFB8-DD6D-11EE-85FB-C779C4E1B7A2^5^^ASCRIBE^GUID|

Currently, it has the GUID ^ Number. 

What is that GUID and what is that number? 

According to the documentation, this is the:

3.5 - - - Identifier Type Code
3.6 - -Assigning Facility

