\\wwlemissql\LIVE\Mediate\270\Export\
\\wwlemissql\LIVE\Mediate\270\Import\

and so on for each site number

Powergate are saying that the directory where they are normally picked up from 

\\wwlemissql\LIVE\Mediate\TecSol\orders\ - Is empty

it is empty, so powergate cannot pick them up.

Time that the issue was first noticed; was anything specific that user or site (maintenance, upgrade etc) was doing at that point? -

case logged on 28th but may have been an issue since 25th.

