"CS1630067","Lancashire Teaching Hospitals NHS Foundation Trust","3 - Medium","07/08/2025 15:30:02","Closed","Log file viewer  / PMR issue.","22/09/2025 11:59:49","system","Acute Care Medicines Management Level 1 Team","Swati Dongare","21/08/2025 17:36:33 - Swati Dongare (Work notes)
