Passing to PA's, Minimum data set below :-

A clear description of the Problem - The dose is overdue for a prescription

Time that the issue was first noticed; was anything specific that user or site (maintenance, upgrade etc) was doing at that point? -NA

Details of any error messages appearing and their corresponding error log(s) -attached

Look to include screenshots where possible -attached

Details of the system configuration (region/organisation etc.) -NA

Details on the user or user type reporting the issue -Prescribers

Machine specific or full hardware estate impacted e.g. Printing failure for all or one specific user/machine? -NA

Details on any relevant data condition (organisation/user/patient/system) -NA

Clinical Safety / Security / Information Governance Risk -Yes

Clinical Safety / Information Governance statement -Yes

Workaround offered or provided – Not provided

What Investigation have you carried out / what knowledge based articles have you used - I have run the Event engine full drug admin and checked and confirmed  the wards in  ePMA group

A clear set of recreation steps -Open the Drug chart and select the patient.

