The 'Ward Stock' button within the ePMA Technician/Pharmacist desktops is not functioning correctly. If you mark an item as ward stock and then review the item history, it is actually marked as 'Not Ward Stock'. This has caused confusion when Pharmacy staff cancel nurse supply requests because items are on a stock list, only for the nurses to see in the item history that an item is marked as not ward stock?

