Grace meeting:

CS1641322 – inform the customer that the “Sus” flags on the doses look correct as on the weeks where there is no dose it puts it on all the doses to show that this is suspended but there is no dose behind them. Ian to test same behavior with the additional dose on a daily frequency as it looks to create one for Every 6 weeks but not Every 4 weeks. Then do the same on tests on Live. Also compare the frequencies in Editor – Frequency to see if this is to with whether the day flags are ticket or not.

