acutedss.emishealth.com is in the trusted list. They have gone through this on their group policy and set it up but it remains on processing instead of moving to the next screen.

Passing back up as all checks I can do have now been done.

Trust is unable to use the DSS Drug Definition Requests desktop

When they access it the screen look normal. then they click next and it stays on processing. (as shown in DSS Drug Definition Request not working (4).docx attached)

When we Optum do this on their Servers the screen changes as it should to allow to you to then enter details (as shown in cs1642243.png attached)

--Time that the issue was first noticed; was anything specific that user or site (maintenance, upgrade etc) was doing at that point? -

first reported on CS1593294 at 02/06/2025 15:41:18 case auto closed due to no response from customer
