DSS Drug Definition Request not working (4).docx attached this is what customer gets - not working

cs1642243.png attached this is what we get when we try to do it - working


--Workaround offered or provided –

No workaround

--What Investigation have you carried out / what knowledge based articles have you used -

Via email I have advised on checking the edge settings for IE compatibility mode
Checking
https://acutedss.emishealth.com/dssonwebsite/DrugDefinitionRequest is added to the compatibly view settings as in CS1593294

There is very little we can check as it works on the servers

There machines browsers are managed by group policy and the browsers are locked down from the front end.

I have tried to arrange multiple meeting to check this with them but it either keeps being delayed or i get no response.

Due to the age of the case from initial reporting i am now raising this case up to PA's for further investigation.

All documents have been sent to them and they say it is all set up as per the document bu the issue remains.

I cant check this as i cant get a meeting with them for last couple of month with them showing me an affected machine.

