30/10/2025 10:13:40 - Michael Carter (Work notes)
Hello, problem was not fixed,
I did some digging and the Reg Key you ask me to add is not persistent ex below:

The Volatile Environment key exists only while the user is logged in.
•	It is rebuilt from scratch every time the user logs on.
•	Any changes there (like adding viewclient_machine_name) disappear at logoff.
That means pushing a permanent key there won’t persist unless recreate every logon.

I will work on a permanent fix, adding the key each time users are logging to the device, but I wonder if this will still work, I had a session with Jessican added the reg key fallowed all the steps but when we check her activation it was still active but device name was still “Terminal” not proper hostname.

and the other issue regarding printing.
If I install a new printer and add it for one user how can I make sure it will be added for all users, not to ask everyone to search the printer under print preferencies?

Any ideas?
best regards,
Ciprian Negru

