Passing to PA's, Minimum data set below :-

A clear description of the Problem -

Item has been added onto the drug chart with a frequency of every 3 days, however a dose has appeared on the next days (two consecutive days) which should not have happened. The history of the item does not show a dose being added on for the 13th august.

We have investigated this further and dug out some audits and found that user TamangN had gone into this patients record on 2025-08-10 23:14:31.620 and the audit shows the and this user had gone into the same drug and has made a change. The audit shows that a dose has been created on 2025-08-10 for requested for 2025-08-13 08:00:00.

We checked this users permissions they only have permission to a few desktop and it seems like they have gone into the select inpatient desktop and then selected the patient and then gone into the nursing desktop and made some changes from there.

