A clear description of the Problem -

Berkshire have confirmed their issue matches PRB0051839 whereby When EPMA window is minimized or windows lock is used to lock the PC whilst EPMA minimized and on a patient record and/or making amendments - the 15-minute system inactivity countdown does not appear to commence until logged back into the PC and/or the window is maximized again. This could be after several hours meaning the record has remained locked to other users during this time.

Berkshire also have other concerns below and would like to know a time scale of when this issue is going to be fixed.

Other questions have been asked below, see answers to these in previous comments. 

