19/09/2025 10:00:31 - Ian Holden (Work notes)
Grace Lloyd:  investigating the root cause is going to take some time so at the moment we advise the customer to rollback the patch, install the client, then reinstall the patch. If they have issues printing other reports, check if they are Crystal reports and follow the same steps as the stockdiff, replace with an rtf version and switch the config setting UseCrystal to ""N""

18/09/2025 16:31:06 - Ian Holden (Work notes)
Hi Stacey,

I hope you're doing well.

Firstly, I'd like to sincerely apologise for the delay in getting back to you and thank you for your patience, it's truly appreciated.

I wanted to let you know that our development team has been actively investigating the issue. We're committed to resolving this as quickly as possible and will share a further update with you tomorrow to keep you informed of our progress.

We understand how important this is to you, and please rest assured that we're doing everything we can to get it resolved.

In the meantime, if you have any questions or need anything further, please don't hesitate to reach out.

Kind Regards 

Janette

