Machine specific or full hardware estate impacted e.g. Printing failure for all or one specific user/machine? -no

Details on any relevant data condition (organisation/user/patient/system) -patient

Clinical Safety / Security / Information Governance Risk -no

Clinical Safety / Information Governance statement -no

Workaround offered or provided –no

What Investigation have you carried out / what knowledge based articles have you used - KB5000345/PRB0047424(only checking) 

A clear set of recreation steps -

Replicated the same step getting same error (only happed  with this user)
-checking all details and episode for that patient did  to get any discrepancies 
