@Muhammed Rashik Rahman Do the following:

For us to do:
Multi-Route Stat dose order sets (The Paracetamol ones at the top) PRB0051208 - 2 issues; 1 it leaves them on the Clinical Checking Worklist which the workaround deals with, 2nd issue is that they don't get a Complete flag on the requeststatus table. IF the doses have had responses you may need to manually give them the Complete/Expired flags.

Downtime was around 22nd/23rd of June 2025. That looks to be what has stopped the 2 Discontinued Omeprazole prescriptions from disappearing. (PRB0052968) -test manually marking the prescriptions as expired on request status and see if that moves it to the History. If it doesn't discuss with Stan if he can test overriding one of them to be a different Response on the dose, then see if the Event engine then moves it to the history.

For site to do:
Ciprofloxacin has an overdue dose on 27th of July, that's why it's still on the drug chart.

Sodium Chloride 0.9% Infusion has lots of overdue doses around the 4th of July.

Plasma-Lyte 148 In water Infusion also has Overdue doses.

