13/10/2025 14:45:55 - Paul Warburton (Work notes)
Arachis Oil to Peanut is in current datasheet as a contra indication . Contra indications not a current requirement of the ePMA product and data is not supplied to customers.
Only Drug to Drug Allergy support checking is supported for the ePMA solution.
Allergies against Food and Non food can be recorded but not take part in any active checking within the decision support module
As part of investigation possible solutions :

i   Publish a note with relevant information in the extra detail against the published prescribing template for arachis oil enema . 
ii  Reallocate Peanut to an active ingredient and add a new cross allergy group with arachis oil
iii New development to display to users to check any recorded  food allergies when prescribing new drugs

