"CS1666606","Cheshire and Wirral Partnership NHS Foundation Trust","3 - Medium","09/10/2025 08:36:42","Closed","Issues with Label Printer ZD420 at Fairview","24/10/2025 11:07:27","system","Acute Care Medicines Management Level 1 Team","Sean Prescott","24/10/2025 11:07:27 - System (Work notes)
