When we first experienced these issues a few weeks ago there were issues with ordering on site 461 but there were also issues with ad-hoc printing stock labels on site 461 and printing picking tickets/delivery notes on both sites (461 + 462) – all within the Stores part of the system. We no longer appear to be having issues with ad-hoc printing stock labels and printing picking tickets/delivery notes, but the problems with orders is still ongoing. As explained in the responses below in red there are only certain users who use this part of the system – not many users would authorise orders/credit orders. email attached

