28/05/2026 12:46:00 - Ian Holden (Work notes)
NH:
Can you please add this to the case and look to amend the data for the site. I think I have got to the bottom of why this item will not complete the manufacture issue process in the dispensary
After trying to replicate it a number of times I eventually managed to get a ‘mab’ product to break in the same way as the site are experiencing.
The problem lay in the DPSform being set to ‘x’ in the siteproductdata table.  
As soon as I removed the X from the DPSform field it worked as expected and proceeded to manufacture. This will have been copied over from the DSS product I suspect when the product was created/ copied from the DSS line.

