"CS1683413","Berkshire Healthcare NHS Foundation Trust","4 - Low","05/11/2025 18:27:54","Closed","Finance-Invoice listing report-0367 is missing didnot run from 24/10/25","02/12/2025 09:52:56","system","Acute Care Medicines Management Level 1 Team","Azeem Parvez","18/11/2025 10:11:05 - Azeem Parvez (Work notes)
The reason why this happened was due to the 'Missed task start rejected' with event id 153. With a quick google search this is due to the computer being off at the scheduled time. 

I have but an action in place which should prevent this from happening again which is a setting in the job which 'runs task as soon as possible after a scheduled start is missed'

This should prevent the job from not running when instances such as the 'machine being shut down' occur.

