A clear description of the Problem -

Trust have been reporting that normal orders and PSO order are producing the same order number when they should be different order numbers.
This has been reported a few times by this customer and the resolution has been to say it is being investigated under PRB0050243. This PRB is resolved. I have not reopened it as suggested i will leave this to the PA's to do if this is related to the PRB or create a new PRB

When they try to receive good from the stores they get this is a PSO order. 

When they go to look at receiving the order from PSO it shows one line.

The normal order has 5 lines on it.

So a total of 6 lines between the normal internal order and the PSO 

Time that the issue was first noticed; was anything specific that user or site (maintenance, upgrade etc) was doing at that point? -

CS1624279	28/07 - linked to PRB0050243

CS1680177 	30/10 - linked to PRB0050243

CS1685992	11/11 - linked to PRB0050243

