only message is when trying to retrive goods for order number stating that this is a PSO order 290957 and to retrieve it from there

Look to include screenshots where possible -

please refer to 

Order290957.jpg

CS1693011.docx

Workaround offered or provided – Yes 

customer has been told not to create suppliers with line feeds or carriage returns. they have not been doing this and i have checked the suppliers for these there are none

NOTE - I also suggested receiving the PSO order number as a workaround then they can receive the goods which are not a PSO order.

They advised this could work as a temp workaround but the PSO order takes longer to get the confirmation it has been delivered than a normal order. So they would only do this one the PSO has been confirmed so it can then be invoiced.

Then they would receive the normal goods.

As a result this hold up receiving the stock from the normal order with the same order number.

In short the system should not be generating the same order number

Have you followed all of the steps of the workaround provided on PRB - Yes

Does the current workaround work - No
--If No selected from above state reason why not working and provide screenshots of the errors.

There are no carriage returns or line feeds

What Investigation have you carried out / what knowledge based articles have you used - 

