But to see the error

go to 

NTGH Pharmacy - Stores (8) Ward (4) 857

Click orders then receive goods

enter order number 290957 

Error pops up (as in CS1693011.docx attached)

Order Number : 290957. This is a patient specific order. Please receive this as a patient specific order.

remember Order290957.jpg shows 6 line which includes the pso 

Go to Orders

received Patient specific goods enter order number 290957 it returns one line

See (CS1693011.docx attached) in the database this line has a PSO requestID against the order number the the other 5 lines do not which are all internal orders
You can also see the pso order was created about 5 minutes after the first 5 internal line where ordered.

