"CS1695814","Bradford Teaching Hospitals NHS Foundation Trust","3 - Medium","27/11/2025 15:58:26","Closed","Consultants","19/12/2025 12:05:39","bijan.movahed@bthft.nhs.uk","Acute Care Medicines Management Level 1 Team","Gunjan Idnani","11/12/2025 12:04:49 - Gunjan Idnani (Work notes)
Just to let you know this case for Bradford - Tara ,Kristian and myself have looked at and identified why the Consultant is not pulled through from the PAS feed. 
It is because that data needs to be carried in the PV1-9 segment.  I have conveyed that information to the site so that they can implement it into their Test environment because we need it to be able to progress our ePrescribing interface project. 
At some point later, when they are happy, the site will cascade the same fix to their Live PAS feed.

