Passing to PA's, Minimum data set below :-

--A clear description of the Problem -

NOTE: this is Parkside Hospital (Nuffield Health) - 134173 on support portal but called Cancer Centre London LLP (Icon) on service now

Trust is having a recurring issue with printing labels. As they take far too long to print.

If the system needs to print 6 or more labels there is a significant delay in printing the label when it get to the 5th Label

Historically its been slow and the printing of 5 labels is slow as soon as it gets to the 6th label and more there is a significant delay of about 30 seconds before it prints each label after.

When they are doing this repeatedly this time adds up and slows them down a lot

--Time that the issue was first noticed; was anything specific that user or site (maintenance, upgrade etc) was doing at that point? -

