"CS1711555","Northumbria Healthcare NHS Foundation Trust","3 - Medium","05/01/2026 10:05:21","Closed","LIVE 10.23 - Printing Picking Tickets from Robot Interface","15/01/2026 10:41:57","system","Acute Care Medicines Management Level 1 Team","Azeem Parvez","08/01/2026 15:19:13 - Azeem Parvez (Work notes)
After further investigation, i found from looking at the XLM attached. The code in the XML which translates to the wardcode in our system is not correct. The wardcode CEAG does not exist in our system.

I called jonathan and he advised the full ward name is CRAM Emergency Care Green.

I searched for this on the backend and found that this wardcode is actually CAEG not CEAG. 

select * from icwsys.wcustomer where code ='CAEG'

select * from icwsys.WSupplier where code ='CEAG'

select * from icwsys.WSupplier where FullName like '%Cram%'

I advised Jonathan that Omnicell have put in the wrong code and need to ammend this so it translates correctly,

Advised Jonathan to speak to Omnicell and correct this and it should resolve the issue.

