""The reorder pack size for this item is 6 ( 6 amps in a box) which is correct (number of issue units, amps in the pack) The column titled 'pack' displays that 'dispensing pack size' which is generally the same as the re order pack size, except for 'wet' items we hold the mLs per pack (number of mLs in a pack which is correct at 5 (mLs) hence why they are different. These figures are supplied by DSS hence why they are locked down and fundamental for dispensing calculations.
