Hello,

It looks you tried to add these episodes in with an A05 which is for Pre-Admit. Surely if it's in the past it's not pre-admittance?

Can you try sending it as an A04 please? (Register a patient Trigger Event)

Also for PV1.2 (Patient Class) I think this should be I or O for Inpatient/Outpatient. You look to have put 1 for that field.

Kind Regards,

Michael

