13/01/2026 13:28:33 - Azeem Parvez (Work notes)
Adta01 

Pv1.10 requires the specialty mapping code. (rio) 
]in example patient PV1.10 is blank

|ADT^A01

When looking into the HL7 for patient example, we found that under ADT A01 which is patient admit, under PV1.10 which should have the specialty mapping code, this is blank and does not exist. 

We believe in this scenario RIO is not sending the speciality code which is why they are having to add this in. 

RIO need to include the speciality mapping code in their messages so we can process this. Our config is setup to accept the specialty code and is enabled.

