Mark :

CS1726012   I think we need a prb creating if we don't have one already so that safety can assess it. 
 
The customer seems to have tested and confirmed that as I suspected ""the alert appears when the originally recorded dose reaches the maximum limit. Conversely, if the dose is below this limit, it allows for the recording of a smaller dose without triggering an alert. Consequently, the message displayed in the screenshot for Cetirizine may not be appropriate. Mark noted that if a larger dose exceeding the limit is entered, one would expect a warning message, which the system currently does not generate"" So the issue applies to variable dose When required prescriptions with a total dose over time period rule attached.

