The UPDATE statement conflicted with the FOREIGN KEY constraint ""FK_ascEMMIntervention_ascEMMInterventionLocation_ascEMMInterventionLocationID"". The conflict occurred in database ""EHSC_HAP_LIVE"", table ""icwsys.ascEMMInterventionLocation"", column 'ascEMMInterventionLocationID'.

Actually the locaion is a foreign key of a table ascEMMInterventionLocation that doesn't have the all location details as in the previous query. I can see that there is location is '0' which is described as 'Nithing selected' which is matching null value, we can set 0

