Passing to PA's, Minimum data set below :-

A clear description of the Problem -Mandated fields not mandating

Time that the issue was first noticed; was anything specific that user or site (maintenance, upgrade etc) was doing at that point? -NO 

Details of any error messages appearing and their corresponding error log(s) -No 

Look to include screenshots where possible -attached 

Details of the system configuration (region/organisation etc.) -No 

Details on the user or user type reporting the issue -No 

Machine specific or full hardware estate impacted e.g. Printing failure for all or one specific user/machine? -No 

Details on any relevant data condition (organisation/user/patient/system) -No 

Clinical Safety / Security / Information Governance Risk -No 

Clinical Safety / Information Governance statement -No 

Workaround offered or provided –  No

Have you followed all of the steps of the workaround provided on PRB -  No

Does the current workaround work - No
--If No selected from above state reason why not working and provide screenshots of the errors.

What Investigation have you carried out / what knowledge based articles have you used - 

A clear set of recreation steps -

During a recent meeting with Charlotte , we discussed an issue that has arisen following the upgrade. Users are experiencing difficulties with Mandated fields not mandating ; specifically, when they enter the detail and direction , it is not getting any pop to select mandatory field as it was previously. Consequently, they are able to process with that mandatory field which should not as per process

The same process has been replicated for several sites for both version, as detailed in the attached document.

Need to check with the product team?

Thanks,
swati

