Firstly, checked in Utilities > Set / Report Working Defaults:
14) Pseudo NSV code for carriage costs: usually set as ASC000C
15) Pseudo NSV code for discounts: usually set as ASC000D
35) Pseudo NSV Code for reconciliation: usually set as ASC000R

If these are all set correctly, then check the products have been imported into the site where the issue persists:

SELECT S.sitenumber, w.*
from wproduct w
join site s
on w.locationid_site = s.locationid
where w.siscode in ('asc000c','asc000d','asc000r')
and s.sitenumber in (759,760)

