Site had historically been using the Lifetime episodes for Homecare Prescriptions, some of these prescriptions have now been archived. Site has been trained that they should be using a Homecare episode. 

Can we back out of the eMM tidy tool?
Can we exclude episodes if the location was ever a Homecare location?

They also need options on how to see the historical ones. Already suggested that they look in History desktop as that is the only place they will be able to see cancelled prescriptions.

Graham is going to do some digging and re-arrange a meeting with site.

