I have reviewed the indexing and confirmed that it is appropriate, with no recommendations for index rebuild or alteration. The scheduled job is running as expected. Although no alerts have been triggered recently, the customer would like to understand why this issue continues to occur intermittently. At this stage, an exact root cause has not been identified.

