27/05/2026 10:50:17 - Michael Carter (Work notes)
Check if the logging is on for for the robot:

select * from wconfiguration where value like '%smec%'

[Key] = logging should have the value of ""SMEC"" for the robot logs to be on.

If it's on this will get the logs for it:

select top 1000 * from WPharmacyLog
where WPharmacyLogTypeID in (
	select WPharmacyLogTypeID from WPharmacyLogType where description like 'MechDisp')
order by 1 desc

This can be further filtered down to DateTime, EntityID_User, or by what Terminal they are activated on.

Ask if site can get on the DB to look at those or if they want to provide some more specific filtering for us to retrieve the records for them.

