Had a look at the case info and it does looks like a bug. My theory here is that if you enter a 4 line address it updates all 4 lines. Then if you update it to a 2 lines address it updates those 2 lines but leave line 3 and 4 of the previous address. 

Need to go onto the PAS Management console and pull those messages along with the XML that runs. It's the XML that calls SPs to update lines. See if the XML calls one SP for updating address or if it's one for each, I suspect one for address.

