Passing to PA's, Minimum data set below :-

A clear description of the Problem -Muktiroute not allow doses to be added when prescribed

Time that the issue was first noticed; was anything specific that user or site (maintenance, upgrade etc) was doing at that point? -

Details of any error messages appearing and their corresponding error log(s) -

Look to include screenshots where possible -attached 

Details of the system configuration (region/organisation etc.) -no

Details on the user or user type reporting the issue -no

Machine specific or full hardware estate impacted e.g. Printing failure for all or one specific user/machine? -no

Details on any relevant data condition (organisation/user/patient/system) -no

Clinical Safety / Security / Information Governance Risk -no

Clinical Safety / Information Governance statement -

Workaround offered or provided – No

Have you followed all of the steps of the workaround provided on PRB - No

Does the current workaround work - No
--If No selected from above state reason why not working and provide screenshots of the errors.

What Investigation have you carried out / what knowledge based articles have you used - 

A clear set of recreation steps -

Upon review, it appears that this feature is disabled, preventing them from modifying the dosage. In discussions with them, it was mentioned that they have created a blank multi-route dosage for Paracetamol (for all multi-routes). They have conducted tests, but it does not allow for the addition of dosages at the prescribing stage, as the usual input box is absent.


As discussed with Mark :-  First impression is that this is not working as designed and will need a PRB

