I have implemented the update and the customer has tested it. Unfortunately, there was no change, and the system is still printing the old layout rather than the expected one.
I discussed this with Emily, who advised that the existing layout cannot be amended, as there is currently no editor available to modify it. The layout the customer has requested was originally printed using Crystal Reports, whereas the current solution uses an RTF layout.
The Crystal Reports version was discontinued after Windows updates caused compatibility issues, and it can no longer be used.
If the customer requires the old layout or similar functionality, they will need to raise an enhancement request for the new RTF layout to be updated or redesigned accordingly.

